{"version":1,"content":"<p>近日氣溫及濕度明顯下降，皮膚亦隨之而變得乾燥敏感。</p><p>近期掀起水油水護膚法，簡單三個步驟就能有效深層補水及鎖住水分，使肌膚在季節交替時仍能保持水潤透亮。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;水油水護膚法十分簡單，首先潔面後取約10元硬幣大</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:23:46.963398+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T08:00:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:18:59.144625+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:18:59.144625+00:00","content_hash":"eb88ed169a5cbcd89c7dd54c64db78887e4638bc565d1a065f5b0efa9fbffa09","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}